==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|þakka|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*þankōną}}, cognate with the English {{term|thank|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈθahka/|lang=is}}
* {{audio|Is-þakka.ogg|Audio|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ahka|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|þakkaði|þakkað}}

# to [[thank]]

====Conjugation====
{{is-conj-w4|þ|a|kk}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|is|þökk}}

